            "YouTube": "Ví dụ: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ (hỗ trợ Shorts, Music, Playlist)",
            "Facebook": "Ví dụ: https://www.facebook.com/user/videos/123456789 hoặc fb.watch/xxx",
